\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab FATHER of everlasting grace,
\par \pard\li720 Thy goodness and Thy truth we praise,
\par Thy goodness and Thy truth we prove ;
\par Thou hast, in honour of Thy son,
\par The gift unspeakable sent down,
\par The Spirit of live, and power, and love.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab Send us the Spirit of Thy son,
\par \pard\li720 To make the depths of Godhead known,
\par To make us share the life divine ;
\par Send Him the sprinkled blood to apply ,
\par Send Him our souls to sanctify ,
\par And show and seal us ever Thine.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab So shall we pray, and never cease,
\par \pard\li720 So shall we thankfully confess
\par Thy wisdom, truth, and power, and love ;
\par With joy unspeakable adore,
\par And bless and praise Thee evermore
\par And serve Thee as Thy hosts above :
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Till, added to that heavenly choir,
\par \pard\li720 We raise our songs of triumph higher,
\par And praise Thee in a blolder strain,
\par Out-soar the first-born seraph's flight,
\par And sing, with all our friens in light,
\par \pard             Thy everlasting love to man\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

